 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Send `X-Larder-Site: annex` to select a site; omitted headers select `main`.
+Header names are case insensitive. Unknown sites return HTTP 400 with code
+`unknown_site`. Batches (including reads and waste by id), stock on hand,
+cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes use only the selected site's
+locations. Receiving orders requires destinations in that site. Cross-site
+batch ids return `unknown_batch`; stock-take ids return `not_found`, and
+locations outside the site return `unknown_location`. Items, suppliers,
+recipes and dishes are shared.
