 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` contains site records (`id`, `name`). Every location has a `site`
+  referencing one of them; location ids remain globally unique. Batches and
+  stock-takes belong to the site of their location.
+- Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 by adding the main site and assigning all
+  existing locations to it. Schema 1 files migrate through schema 2 first.
+- The seed includes main and annex, with an annex-fridge at 4 °C.
